    "sections": {
        "description": "A block theme for sports clubs, leagues and tournament organisers, with built-in MeinTurnierplan.de integration for match schedules, results and standings. Built for the Site Editor with theme.json and a library of ready-made patterns - headers, footers, hero sections, calls to action, service and post cards, quotes, alerts, and Latest and Upcoming Matches sections. Includes a theme icon collection for the core Icon block, custom block styles, editor styles that match the front end, and the bundled Inter font. Translation ready."
    },
